{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must survive by eliminating the endless waves of zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area has a boss zombie that must be eliminated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no weapons. You must upgrade your fighting skills and fight against the zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Story:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a virus spreads across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an unknown city,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a family luckily survived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are a family of three generations living together, skilled in martial arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They survive by eliminating zombies using martial arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the days passed, the zombies increased in number, threatening the family's survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The family was terrified of the zombies, but they survived by eliminating them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They lived day by day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, they discovered the presence of a zombie commanding the zombies. To eliminate them,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >they began to eliminate zombies throughout the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer Story:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scared of Zombies is a solo game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've developed this in a challenging environment, so there are many shortcomings, but we appreciate your understanding and hope you enjoy the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4028610?t=1759644357","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028610/ea669b3778d6a34f4c16d3928d58158169547e4b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759644357","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028610/053a935360d2e81fdede91d87230a67340dee2aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759644357","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028610/053a935360d2e81fdede91d87230a67340dee2aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759644357","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must survive by eliminating the endless waves of zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area has a boss zombie that must be eliminated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no weapons. You must upgrade your fighting skills and fight against the zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Story:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a virus spreads across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an unknown city,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a family luckily survived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are a family of three generations living together, skilled in martial arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They survive by eliminating zombies using martial arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the days passed, the zombies increased in number, threatening the family's survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The family was terrified of the zombies, but they survived by eliminating them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They lived day by day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, they discovered the presence of a zombie commanding the zombies. To eliminate them,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >they began to eliminate zombies throughout the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer Story:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scared of Zombies is a solo game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've developed this in a challenging environment, so there are many shortcomings, but we apprecia